{
    "title": "TikiCam: Pro HD Beauty Camera",
    "description": "TikiCam: Pro HD Beauty Camera provides tons of features that allow users to take better, higher-quality pictures anytime they like. With face detection, color effects, scene modes, white balance, exposure compensation, burst mode, and more, HD fancy camera for Android is packed with tools to edit and configure photos.\r\n\r\nFace Edit According to Weight\r\nNo need to wait for a workout plan to show its effects on your face. Our innovative face editing feature dynamically adjusts your facial structure based on your weight preferences. Look leaner or fuller\u2014the choice is yours!\r\n\r\nMonkey Mask\r\nGet playful with our Monkey Mask feature of the Tiki Change Background - Collart app. Whether you're aiming for hilarity or just some good, clean fun, this feature will transform you into the life of the party.\r\n\r\nAging Filter\r\nCurious about how you'll look when you're older? Our Aging Filter takes you on a fascinating journey into the future, showing you a realistic depiction of your older self.\r\n\r\nPhoto Background Changer\r\nStuck with a dull background? Change photo background easily! Our picture background editor, also known as the background er\u03b1\u0455er, lets you replace or modify your photo backdrop easily. No more worrying about a less-than-ideal setting ruining your perfect shot thanks to the background rem\u03bfver - change background eraser app.\r\n\r\nNeon Selfie Editor\r\nGive your selfies a trendy, futuristic look with our Neon Selfie Editor. With radiant hues and luminous effects, stand out from the ordinary and glow like never before!\r\n\r\nHairstyle Changer\r\nSwitch between different hairstyles effortlessly with this feature. Whether you're in the mood for a radical change or a subtle shift, we've got you covered.\r\n\r\nBlur with Filters\r\nAchieve that professional bokeh effect that you see on dslr camera-360 shots. With our blur with filters feature, create a depth-of-field effect that will make your photos look like they were taken with a pro camera 360.\r\n\r\nCamera Features\r\nTikiCam combines the best of various cameras to bring you an unparalleled photo-editing experience. Our camera feature ensures high-quality photos, while the pro camera mode gives you control over intricate settings, making TikiCam a robust cameras app that caters to all your photography needs.\r\n\r\nLevel-up your selfies with TikiCam: App Photo Background Expander ;)\r\n\r\nDownload and try this high-quality and easy-to-use Camera Change Background of Photo app because having too many cameras and photo editing apps can be pretty heavy for our phone memory so it is better to have an app like dispo HD Camera Pro installed. It will let you take high-quality pictures and allow you to do edits that can rival heavy-duty photo editing software afterward. All of those can be done in the same app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "TikiCam: Pro HD Beauty Camera provides tons of features that allow users to take better, higher-quality pictures anytime they like. With face detection, color effects, scene modes, white balance, exposure compensation, burst mode, and more, HD fancy camera for Android is packed with tools to edit and configure photos.<br><br>Face Edit According to Weight<br>No need to wait for a workout plan to show its effects on your face. Our innovative face editing feature dynamically adjusts your facial structure based on your weight preferences. Look leaner or fuller\u2014the choice is yours!<br><br>Monkey Mask<br>Get playful with our Monkey Mask feature of the Tiki Change Background - Collart app. Whether you&#39;re aiming for hilarity or just some good, clean fun, this feature will transform you into the life of the party.<br><br>Aging Filter<br>Curious about how you&#39;ll look when you&#39;re older? Our Aging Filter takes you on a fascinating journey into the future, showing you a realistic depiction of your older self.<br><br>Photo Background Changer<br>Stuck with a dull background? Change photo background easily! Our picture background editor, also known as the background er\u03b1\u0455er, lets you replace or modify your photo backdrop easily. No more worrying about a less-than-ideal setting ruining your perfect shot thanks to the background rem\u03bfver - change background eraser app.<br><br>Neon Selfie Editor<br>Give your selfies a trendy, futuristic look with our Neon Selfie Editor. With radiant hues and luminous effects, stand out from the ordinary and glow like never before!<br><br>Hairstyle Changer<br>Switch between different hairstyles effortlessly with this feature. Whether you&#39;re in the mood for a radical change or a subtle shift, we&#39;ve got you covered.<br><br>Blur with Filters<br>Achieve that professional bokeh effect that you see on dslr camera-360 shots. With our blur with filters feature, create a depth-of-field effect that will make your photos look like they were taken with a pro camera 360.<br><br>Camera Features<br>TikiCam combines the best of various cameras to bring you an unparalleled photo-editing experience. Our camera feature ensures high-quality photos, while the pro camera mode gives you control over intricate settings, making TikiCam a robust cameras app that caters to all your photography needs.<br><br>Level-up your selfies with TikiCam: App Photo Background Expander ;)<br><br>Download and try this high-quality and easy-to-use Camera Change Background of Photo app because having too many cameras and photo editing apps can be pretty heavy for our phone memory so it is better to have an app like dispo HD Camera Pro installed. It will let you take high-quality pictures and allow you to do edits that can rival heavy-duty photo editing software afterward. All of those can be done in the same app.",
